    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after an enemy unit picks its targets, and choose both:\n\n- a **KABAL** or **BLADES FOR HIRE** unit of yours that at least one of that enemy unit's attacks targets\n- any **DRUKHARI** unit of yours, **VEHICLES** excluded\n\nFor the rest of the phase, whenever an attack would be allocated to a model in the **KABAL** or **BLADES FOR HIRE** unit while the attacking model is in **[Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)** of the **DRUKHARI** unit:\n\n- skip the saving throw for that attack\n- the **DRUKHARI** unit suffers **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** matching the attack's Damage characteristic instead",
